192
00:06:39,109 --> 00:06:40,634
market maker.

193
00:06:40,904 --> 00:06:43,086
FanDuel launched one with CME Group,

194
00:06:43,086 --> 00:06:45,022
the giant futures exchange,

195
00:06:45,022 --> 00:06:47,719
