196
00:06:47,719 --> 00:06:49,054
not legal.

197
00:06:49,484 --> 00:06:52,496
The NBA named Kalshi and Polymarket its

198
00:06:52,496 --> 00:06:55,856
preferred prediction market exchanges.

199
00:06:56,117 --> 00:06:58,917
Let me draw where the money goes.

200
00:06:59,027 --> 00:07:00,759
Here is one big circle,

201
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:03,037
all the trading in July.

202
00:07:03,037 --> 00:07:04,387
Now cut it.

203
00:07:04,387 --> 00:07:06,192
A thin slice for politics,

204
00:07:06,192 --> 00:07:09,077
economics and everything else.

205
00:07:09,147 --> 00:07:10,357
And the rest,

206
00:07:10,357 --> 00:07:11,877
about four fifths,

207
00:07:11,877 --> 00:07:13,097
