208
00:07:13,117 --> 00:07:14,818
A market for hunches,

209
00:07:14,818 --> 00:07:17,391
mostly about who wins the game.

210
00:07:17,650 --> 00:07:20,050
Which raises the obvious question.

211
00:07:20,090 --> 00:07:21,930
If it looks like sports betting,

212
00:07:21,930 --> 00:07:24,260
