213
00:07:24,260 --> 00:07:25,325
betting?

214
00:07:30,984 --> 00:07:33,824
The rules have not always been friendly.

215
00:07:33,824 --> 00:07:35,177
In twenty twenty-two,

216
00:07:35,177 --> 00:07:38,120
the regulator ordered Polymarket to pay a

217
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,277
one point four million dollars penalty for

218
00:07:40,277 --> 00:07:42,239
running what it called an illegal

219
00:07:42,239 --> 00:07:44,604
unregistered facility.

220
00:07:44,714 --> 00:07:46,724
Then the climate changed.

221
00:07:46,724 --> 00:07:48,594
In July twenty twenty-five,

222
00:07:48,594 --> 00:07:50,906
the company that now operates as

223
00:07:50,906 --> 00:07:53,427
Polymarket US was designated as a

224
00:07:53,427 --> 00:07:55,288
regulated exchange.

225
00:07:55,550 --> 00:07:58,620
Then the states pushed back.

226
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:02,152
Sports betting in America is regulated by

227
00:08:02,152 --> 00:08:02,834
