228
00:08:02,834 --> 00:08:05,550
with its own licenses and taxes.

229
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:08,412
Several states told the platforms that

230
00:08:08,412 --> 00:08:11,074
their sports contracts were simply illegal

231
00:08:11,074 --> 00:08:11,940
bets.

232
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:14,237
The platforms answered that they are

233
00:08:14,237 --> 00:08:16,904
