234
00:08:16,904 --> 00:08:19,072
and that states have no say.

235
00:08:19,317 --> 00:08:21,077
The courts split.

236
00:08:21,237 --> 00:08:23,258
In April twenty twenty-six,

237
00:08:23,258 --> 00:08:25,530
a federal appeals court in the Third

238
00:08:25,530 --> 00:08:27,324
Circuit sided with Kalshi,

239
00:08:27,324 --> 00:08:28,210
