254
00:08:55,884 --> 00:08:57,170
Two appeals courts,

255
00:08:57,170 --> 00:08:59,344
two opposite answers.

256
00:08:59,584 --> 00:09:01,992
Now the question is knocking at the

257
00:09:01,992 --> 00:09:03,394
Supreme Court.

258
00:09:03,494 --> 00:09:05,828
New Jersey has asked the justices to

259
00:09:05,828 --> 00:09:07,064
take the case.

260
00:09:07,154 --> 00:09:08,143
As of today,

261
00:09:08,143 --> 00:09:10,162
they have not decided whether to hear

262
00:09:10,162 --> 00:09:10,964
it.

263
00:09:11,374 --> 00:09:12,154
Meanwhile,

264
00:09:12,154 --> 00:09:14,554
the federal regulator has taken the

265
00:09:14,554 --> 00:09:15,754
