276
00:09:36,504 --> 00:09:37,710
In the middle,

277
00:09:37,710 --> 00:09:38,423
the rope,

278
00:09:38,423 --> 00:09:40,638
a yes or no contract on tonight's

279
00:09:40,638 --> 00:09:41,484
game.

280
00:09:41,514 --> 00:09:43,191
And the referee has not blown the

281
00:09:43,191 --> 00:09:44,350
