282
00:09:44,584 --> 00:09:47,028
So whatever the courts decide,

283
00:09:47,028 --> 00:09:50,048
one part of this business is already

284
00:09:50,048 --> 00:09:50,923
clear.

285
00:09:56,584 --> 00:09:59,414
Do the math on a single trade.

286
00:09:59,464 --> 00:10:01,771
You buy one hundred contracts at fifty

287
00:10:01,771 --> 00:10:02,209
cents,

288
00:10:02,209 --> 00:10:04,424
fifty dollars in total.

289
00:10:04,564 --> 00:10:06,871
Under the formula Kalshi filed,

290
00:10:06,871 --> 00:10:08,776
the fee is about one dollar and

291
